%N A400302 Number T(n,k) of bipartite graphs on vertices {L_1,...,L_n} U {R_1,...,R_n} with exactly k cycles, where (L_i,R_j) can be an edge only if i <= j and all vertex degrees are in {0,2}; triangle T(n,k), n>=0, 0<=k<=max(0,floor((n-1)/2)), read by rows.
%H A400302 Alois P. Heinz, <a href="/A400302/b400302.txt">Rows n = 0..200, flattened</a>
